    FEAT-0001: keep bookings in a CSV file Facilities can open in a spreadsheet
    
    Facilities wants to open the bookings in a spreadsheet. CsvBookingStore
    is a second adapter for the same BookingStore port: a header row, then
    one row per booking. main.ts picks it instead of JsonBookingStore, and
    data/bookings.json became data/bookings.csv.
    
    Its test is one line: the same contract as the other two stores. The
    end-to-end test switched to the CSV store, since that's what yarn start
    uses now.
    
    Nothing in src/core changed, and neither did any core test. Compare the
    version change in room-booking-discover: a smaller change to the file's
    format changed every test.

